gguf-rco step 6f: the dispatch from the profiles - prefill through dequantise +
cuBLAS for every type (the plugin's MMQ measured 12 TFLOP/s on Q4_K / Q2_K,
2.8 s of an 8.3 s chunk), the Gluon path up to 32 rows on row halves, the
batched MMVQ cap 32, and ggml_dequantize's output allocated with new_empty
(0.44 s of zero fills per chunk). Applies after 0022, 0023 and 0024.

